  m_Name: Sound Design_MusicShowcase
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  projectName: Horror Music
  description: "Horror Music Showcase\nHorror is a specialism, not just a genre I
    enjoy. I wrote my Bachelor's thesis on dynamic music in horror games, and that
    research has fed directly into my practice ever since.\n\nThis showcase covers
    a range of horror music work \u2014 including dynamic systems driven by player
    biofeedback, and music redesigns for Alien: Isolation and SOMA. If you want to
    understand how sound shapes fear, this is a good place to start.\n\nAll the music
    is composed and produced by me."
